rned</span></span></h3>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px; vertical-align: top\">\n\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Follow the steps in the table below if the</span></span></span></span></div>\n\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">FNOD is completed with a date of death that is later than the correct MOD, and</span></span></span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Veteran\u2019s benefit checks are <em>not</em> returned.</span></span></span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\n\t\t\t<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px\">\n\t\t\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Step</strong></span></span></span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Action</strong></span></span></span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">1</span></span></span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Determine how much of an overpayment would have been created by entering the correct date of death.</span></span></span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">2</span></span></span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Send a&nbsp;memorandum&nbsp;to the finance activity that&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">explains that the overpayment resulted from an erroneous date of death in the system, and</span></span></span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">requests a fiscal transaction to establish the accounts receivable.</span></span></span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">3</span></span></span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Complete a BIRLS UPDATE to correct the date of death in BIRLS, if not already corrected.</span></span></span></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t</tbody>\n\t\t\t</table>\n\n\t\t\t<div></div>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\">\n<hr /></div>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: right\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000174194\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part XI, Subpart i, Chapter 1, Section B  - System Information for Veteran Notice of Death (NOD) and Month of Death (MOD) Processing\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000174194?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">&lt;-- Previous Section</a></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000174196\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part XI, Subpart i, Chapter 1, Section D  - General Procedures for Non-Veteran Beneficiary Notice of Death (NOD) Processing\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000174196?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">Next Section --&gt;</a></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a href=\"#top\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px\">To Top</span></a></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n",
